      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "1. Normalize schemas\n2. Deduplicate event_id\n3. Resolve sequence-ordered state\n4. Sessionize trips and requests\n5. Join vehicle config as-of event time\n6. Detect versioned stability episodes\n7. Calculate miles/hours/trips exposure\n8. Attribute episodes to release and context\n9. Reprocess late partitions",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Normalize schemas\n2. Deduplicate event_id\n3. Resolve sequence-ordered state\n4. Sessionize trips and requests\n5. Join vehicle config as-of event time\n6. Detect versioned stability episodes\n7. Calculate miles/hours/trips exposure\n8. Attribute episodes to release and context\n9. Reprocess late partitions",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
